WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
STRIKER: your earned pet, a different fighting style.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Start with Strike. It costs no energy and refills your energy bar.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Alternate Strike and Signature to build Combo.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Keep the rhythm. At three Combo, Signature breaks through Guard.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Try this build in Training. Earn permanent equipment with Math Points. Reset talents free between battles.
